$$\Lambda'(a,\widetilde{f_1},\widetilde{f_2}):=\sum_{x,y} \mathbb{E}_{z \in [(N/W_d)^{1/d}V^{-1}]} e(a(y)x) \widetilde{f_1}(x+\widetilde P_{[r, V]}(z),y) \widetilde{f_2}(x,y+\widetilde P_{[r, V]}(z)).$$
