\end{align}
(here we write $(1_{[N/V]\setminus S} \widetilde f_1)(x,y)$ for $1_{[N/V]\setminus S}(y) \widetilde f_1(x,y)$).  Indeed, there is no contribution from the values of $y$ where $a(y) \neq a''(y)$ because for such $y$ we have $(1_{[N/V]\setminus S} \widetilde f_1)(x+\widetilde P_{[r,V]}(z),y)=0$.


