It remains to analyze the sizes of the sets $\widetilde S_{\leq \ell}$ and argue that the procedure terminates after a bounded number of steps.  By \eqref{eq:pseudorandom} applied to each of the sets $S_{\ell,j'}$ (for $j' \in [V']$), we have
$$|\widetilde S_\ell \cap \widetilde S_{\leq \ell-1}| \leq V'(1+2(N/\widetilde V)\exp(\log(1/\delta)^C)\widetilde V/N)<3V'\exp(\log(1/\delta)^C).$$
