for some constant $c>0$ depending only on $P$. Hence $w \leq \exp(\log(1/\delta)^{O(1)})$ and so $W\leq \exp\exp(\log(1/\delta)^{O(1)})$,
which contradicts the assumption on $W$ as long as the $O(1)$ term is sufficiently large.

